          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Yeremia gari axaás i kat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Xáy kuúng aga axaskáhe mukwí iwa kaahi, ‹AAKOÓ MUNGÚ marayká' tsár aa tsawaár gaa sií'.› Inooín muk'eé' nguna waaqaaiyé', dir'ine tari xoororooká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala aníng AAKOÓ MUNGÚ a kah, ‹Barnaxes aníng alqadoodár tlaatla/aangw nee xweera aga gawdeesiiká, nee dabér yaamu nee dooriwo gi geeraharahaar aga qaasiiká, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "daqaní aníng xwaylár Yakobo nee Daudi sagadiyusmooeé' aga sií', nee heé wák u tsawaaraaká oo xwaylár Abrahamu, nee Isaka nee Yakobo ga sawaawuti'iím. Asma aníng muk'eé' un diihhooárí ki/ís nee nguri gurtláw.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
